{
  "title": "Click-Dog: Exported User Activity",
  "description": "Live-span-only review of ClickHouse user activity exported by click-dog from system.opentelemetry_span_log. Searchable tables relate users to databases, tables, statement operations, and access types using automatic query_log enrichment. Counts cover only the qualified/exported stream selected by monitor.min_trace_duration_ms and configured filters; this is an operational view, not a complete audit log. Backfill spans from system.query_log use the separate clickhouse.query/db.* contract and are intentionally outside this dashboard.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "default": "click-dog-monitor"
    },
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "user",
      "prefix": "@query_log.user",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "database",
      "prefix": "@query_log.databases",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "table",
      "prefix": "@query_log.tables",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "operation",
      "prefix": "@query_log.operation",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "access_type",
      "prefix": "@query_log.access_type",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "host",
      "prefix": "@hostname",
      "default": "*"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "# Click-Dog — Exported User Activity\n\n**Live-span dashboard.** Reviews root query spans from `system.opentelemetry_span_log` using `resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log`, with user/database/table/operation metadata from automatic `query_log.*` enrichment.\n\n**Scope.** Counts are exported activity, not total ClickHouse traffic, and this is not a complete audit record. `monitor.min_trace_duration_ms` and query/operation/IP/user filters determine which activity appears.\n\nUse the dashboard filters to narrow every widget. Each relationship table also has a search bar for its visible user, database, table, operation, and access-type values. If operation/access-type widgets are empty while other activity is present, check `click_dog.query_operation_supported`; `0` means the startup `query_kind` capability probe disabled those dimensions.",
        "background_color": "blue",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 12, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Exported Activity Summary\nUsers and statement classes in the qualified live-span stream.",
        "background_color": "green",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "center",
        "show_tick": false,
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 2, "width": 12, "height": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Exported activity (1h)",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0,
        "time": {"live_span": "1h"},
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{"formula": "query1"}],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": []
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 3, "width": 2, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Active users (1h)",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0,
        "time": {"live_span": "1h"},
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{"formula": "query1"}],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "cardinality", "metric": "@query_log.user"},
                "group_by": []
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 2, "y": 3, "width": 2, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Exported reads",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0,
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{"formula": "query1"}],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* @query_log.access_type:read $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": []
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 4, "y": 3, "width": 2, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Exported writes",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0,
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{"formula": "query1"}],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* @query_log.access_type:write $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": []
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 6, "y": 3, "width": 2, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Exported DDL",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0,
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{"formula": "query1"}],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* @query_log.access_type:ddl $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": []
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 8, "y": 3, "width": 2, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Failed exported activity",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0,
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{"formula": "query1"}],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* @query_log.exception_code:>0 $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": []
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 10, "y": 3, "width": 2, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Activity Over Time\nStatement access classes are derived from `system.query_log.query_kind`, not from read/write row counters.",
        "background_color": "green",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "center",
        "show_tick": false,
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 5, "width": 12, "height": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Exported activity by access type",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "horizontal",
        "legend_columns": ["sum"],
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{"formula": "query1"}],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* @query_log.access_type:* $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": [
                  {
                    "facet": "@query_log.access_type",
                    "limit": 10,
                    "sort": {"aggregation": "count", "order": "desc"}
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "style": {"palette": "semantic"},
            "display_type": "bars"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 6, "width": 12, "height": 4}
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Searchable Relationship Lists\nSearch inside each table, or use the dashboard filters to constrain every list together. Multi-value database/table attributes fan out to individual facet values.",
        "background_color": "green",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "center",
        "show_tick": false,
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 10, "width": 12, "height": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Users and access types — exported activity",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_table",
        "has_search_bar": "always",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "alias": "exported activity", "limit": {"count": 100, "order": "desc"}}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": {
                  "fields": ["@query_log.user", "@query_log.access_type"],
                  "sort": {"aggregation": "count", "order": "desc"}
                }
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 11, "width": 12, "height": 5}
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "definition": {
        "title": "User → database — exported activity",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_table",
        "has_search_bar": "always",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "alias": "exported activity", "limit": {"count": 100, "order": "desc"}}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* @query_log.databases:* $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": {
                  "fields": ["@query_log.user", "@query_log.databases", "@query_log.access_type"],
                  "sort": {"aggregation": "count", "order": "desc"}
                }
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 16, "width": 12, "height": 5}
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "definition": {
        "title": "User → table — exported activity",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_table",
        "has_search_bar": "always",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "alias": "exported activity", "limit": {"count": 100, "order": "desc"}}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* @query_log.tables:* $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": {
                  "fields": ["@query_log.user", "@query_log.tables", "@query_log.operation"],
                  "sort": {"aggregation": "count", "order": "desc"}
                }
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 21, "width": 12, "height": 5}
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "definition": {
        "title": "User → operation — exported activity",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_table",
        "has_search_bar": "always",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "alias": "exported activity", "limit": {"count": 100, "order": "desc"}}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "spans",
                "name": "query1",
                "search": {"query": "$service resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log @query_log.user:* @query_log.operation:* $env $user $database $table $operation $access_type $host"},
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": {"aggregation": "count"},
                "group_by": {
                  "fields": ["@query_log.user", "@query_log.operation", "@query_log.access_type"],
                  "sort": {"aggregation": "count", "order": "desc"}
                }
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 26, "width": 12, "height": 5}
    }
  ]
}
